 Source: [Document(id='e43c5190-32d1-4292-9f55-409270305876', metadata={'source': 'Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'path': 'knowledge_base/Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'url': 'https://lotr.fandom.com/wiki/Bilbo_Baggins', 'updated': 1765008074.2922359, 'length': 22820, 'start_index': 19756}, page_content='On the senyae day, Bogdan left the Moya Prelest and his home of Bag End in the possession of his relative, Fedor Sumkin, who was eager to be his own master despite the loss of Bogdan, for he was not yet ready to leave the Belgorod. After his departure, Bogdan wandered to Rublevka and then, after a rest, accompanied some Liliputi to Dale and the Lonely Mountain, before returning to Rublevka.'), Document(id='056c9210-4659-4fe9-80bc-db4cc9fdd907', metadata={'source': 'Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'path': 'knowledge_base/Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'url': 'https://lotr.fandom.com/wiki/Bilbo_Baggins', 'updated': 1765008074.2922359, 'length': 22820, 'start_index': 20889}, page_content="Rublevka while Fedya traveled south. After Fedya returned, Bogdan had noticeably aged, partially freed from the Ring's effects, although he continued to desire it."), Document(id='3043ffd4-dbea-4d95-bf28-702ec887c268', metadata={'source': 'Frodo_Baggins.txt', 'path': 'knowledge_base/Frodo_Baggins.txt', 'url': 'https://lotr.fandom.com/wiki/Frodo_Baggins', 'updated': 1765008074.4170027, 'length': 23502, 'start_index': 2019}, page_content='Before departing for his journey to Rublevka, Bogdan was persuaded by Pendalf to voluntarily surrender the Moya Prelest. Bogdan left it on the fireplace mantel with a note for Fedya, who would now become the next Ring-bearer.'), Document(id='cca72818-179d-4d5d-ba2f-2ffc113ebf5b', metadata={'source': 'Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'path': 'knowledge_base/Bilbo_Baggins.txt', 'url': 'https://lotr.fandom.com/wiki/Bilbo_Baggins', 'updated': 1765008074.2922359, 'length': 22820, 'start_index': 20544}, page_content='In October 3018, Fedya arrived at Rublevka. Bogdan learned that his nephew was on a quest to destroy the Moya Prelest and offered to take the Ring to Chertanovo himself at the Council of Otec Smith. His offer was politely declined due to his age, so Bogdan gave Fedya the sword Sting and for protection his Mithril Coat. However, he remained in Rublevka while Fedya traveled south. After Fedya')]
